  1993-1999. Its embedded notice grants permission to use and modify the
  library as long as the copyright is maintained, modifications are documented,
  and credit is given.

Some legacy support files came from the inherited mochad tree or historical
community maintenance context. See docs/source-lineage.md for the current
provenance record and uncertainty notes.
